# ERROR after 001 ends the link. Most are retried, but not Excess Flood or
# Max SendQ exceeded: reconnecting would send what flooded again (Textual
# cancels the reconnect for both).
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 001 textual :Welcome
< ERROR :Closing Link: textual[127.0.0.1] (Killed (oper (go away)))
> hangup #1
? notice Disconnected: ERROR Closing Link: textual[127.0.0.1] (Killed (oper (go away))); reconnecting in 5 s
? waiting 4.965s
@ wake
> dial #2 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 001 textual :Welcome
< ERROR :Closing Link: textual[127.0.0.1] (Excess Flood)
> hangup #2
? notice Disconnected: ERROR Closing Link: textual[127.0.0.1] (Excess Flood)
? offline server-error
? next-wake none
! connect
> dial #3 irc.test:6667 plain
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
